    <string name="tkb_help_title">How to play Tank Battle</string>
    <string name="tkb_help_text">Take turns firing shells at each other\'s tanks across the hills. Set the angle and the power with the sliders or the plus and minus buttons, or drag back from your tank like a slingshot, pick a shell and press Fire. The dotted line shows the first moments of the shot, wind included. The wind changes every turn: the arrow and number show how hard it pushes. A shell digs a crater where it lands and hurts tanks near it; a direct hit hurts most. A big shell digs wider and hits harder, and a bouncer hops over hills before it explodes, but each tank carries only a few. Last tank standing wins.</string>
