    <string name="tip_tank_battle_1">Set the angle and power with the sliders, or drag back from your tank. The arrow shows the wind.</string>
    <string name="tip_tank_battle_2">A big shell digs a wide crater, and a bouncer hops over hills. Each tank carries only a few.</string>
    <string name="tip_tank_battle_3">Craters change the ground: dig out a rival\'s footing or bury your own tank. Last tank standing wins.</string>
    <string name="tip_shooting_gallery_1">Tap a target to shoot it. Six shots fill the magazine, then it reloads. Spare shots are wasted.</string>
    <string name="tip_shooting_gallery_2">Hit targets in a row to build a combo up to times four. A miss or a decoy breaks it.</string>
    <string name="tip_shooting_gallery_3">Can\'t tap fast? Choose Relaxed pace: slower, larger targets, more time and a quicker reload.</string>
